<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Diebold Inc restarted.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Diebold Inc restarted.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>McDonald &amp; Co said on Tuesday it reinitiated coverage of Diebold Inc with a hold rating.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Matthew Wolfersberger said in a research note his 1997 earnings estimate was $1.75 per share and his 1998 estimate was $2.15 per share.</p>
<p>-- &quot;Although we continue to believe the company will continue to show strong operating results, we have a difficult time recommending purchase of these shares due to its rich valuation based on its current cash flow and earnings potential,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>-- Diebold's stock was off 1-1/8 at 40-5/8.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
